(7386435, 1160147, 68178, '<td valign="top">Self perspective... Have to keep them closed after all, the water hurts. Maybe a quick peek though, to see where you are, then shut again. Don''t want to run into anyone.</td>', 'Self perspective... Have to keep them closed after all, the water hurts. Maybe a quick peek though, to see where you are, then shut again. Don''t want to run into anyone.', '2015-07-13 14:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7386651, 1159781, 62249, '<td valign="top">The lighting isn''t especially flattering for the subject. Also, the processing has made the right side of her face (from viewer''s vantage point) go all posterized, which isn''t the best effect for this type of shot. Still, I can easily imagine her enjoying the scent of the rose.</td>', 'The lighting isn''t especially flattering for the subject. Also, the processing has made the right side of her face (from viewer''s vantage point) go all posterized, which isn''t the best effect for this type of shot. Still, I can easily imagine her enjoying the scent of the rose.', '2015-07-14 00:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7386652, 1160195, 62249, '<td valign="top">Works well in black and white. Like the line of the edge of the pool curving away from the model.</td>', 'Works well in black and white. Like the line of the edge of the pool curving away from the model.', '2015-07-14 00:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7386653, 1160229, 62249, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit more DOF or slightly shifted focus point would enhance this shot. I like the blurred area of her shoulder. Sharpest area of focus seems to be in her hair near the top of her head, and also a small area of the frame of her glasses.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit more DOF or slightly shifted focus point would enhance this shot. I like the blurred area of her shoulder. Sharpest area of focus seems to be in her hair near the top of her head, and also a small area of the frame of her glasses.', '2015-07-14 00:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7386654, 1159486, 62249, '<td valign="top">Water looks good. Consider dodging/lightening her face to draw attention to it.</td>', 'Water looks good. Consider dodging/lightening her face to draw attention to it.', '2015-07-14 00:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7386656, 1160103, 62249, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. The extra structure/local contrast in the processing works well for this subject.</td>', 'Great lighting. The extra structure/local contrast in the processing works well for this subject.', '2015-07-14 00:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7386657, 1160212, 62249, '<td valign="top">The swooping line of the flowers leads my attention away from the eyes. Took me a while to figure out where the eyes were.</td>', 'The swooping line of the flowers leads my attention away from the eyes. Took me a while to figure out where the eyes were.', '2015-07-14 00:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
