(7386660, 1159914, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like that this tells a plausible story for why the model''s eyes are closed instead of just closing the eyes for the sake of the challenge. There are some oddly colored areas in the background (adjacent to the model''s upper eye and below and left of the model''s ear).</td>', 'I like that this tells a plausible story for why the model''s eyes are closed instead of just closing the eyes for the sake of the challenge. There are some oddly colored areas in the background (adjacent to the model''s upper eye and below and left of the model''s ear).', '2015-07-14 00:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
