(7389009, 1160163, 86447, '<td valign="top">What a BEAUTIFUL child!<br/> <br/> <br/>More bland sleepwear would make this perfect... so the wonderful feeling of her innocence and beauty aren''t punctuated at the end of the image with a drawing of a cat... as a surprised interruption to the calm.</td>', 'What a BEAUTIFUL child!  More bland sleepwear would make this perfect... so the wonderful feeling of her innocence and beauty aren''t punctuated at the end of the image with a drawing of a cat... as a surprised interruption to the calm.', '2015-07-18 22:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7389010, 1160210, 86447, '<td valign="top">Why are his eyes closed?     Other than the challenge topic, there''s no reason for them to be closed... and it makes an otherwise wonderfully-done image lesser for it, IMO.</td>', 'Why are his eyes closed?     Other than the challenge topic, there''s no reason for them to be closed... and it makes an otherwise wonderfully-done image lesser for it, IMO.', '2015-07-18 22:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
