(7389012, 1159496, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh!  TOO cute!   <br/> <br/>I love everything about this... except... I can''t see the needle and the syringe plunger... might be my monitor, but they''re gone in the whites.</td>', 'Oh!  TOO cute!    I love everything about this... except... I can''t see the needle and the syringe plunger... might be my monitor, but they''re gone in the whites.', '2015-07-18 22:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
