(7389019, 1160237, 86447, '<td valign="top">What a lovely child!     And I love your idea.<br/> <br/>I wish the BW conversion were a bit better... As someone described it to me, "There needs to be true white and true black... and then shades in between."<br/> <br/>I''m missing the brightness... and it ends up feeling a bit drab.</td>', 'What a lovely child!     And I love your idea. I wish the BW conversion were a bit better... As someone described it to me, "There needs to be true white and true black... and then shades in between." I''m missing the brightness... and it ends up feeling a bit drab.', '2015-07-18 22:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7389020, 1160076, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like this composition.   Althouhg... I''d have cloned out the mascara smudges on her eye... and that bit of something under her nose.<br/> <br/>Add in a bit of contrast and this is lovely!</td>', 'I like this composition.   Althouhg... I''d have cloned out the mascara smudges on her eye... and that bit of something under her nose. Add in a bit of contrast and this is lovely!', '2015-07-18 22:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
