(7389027, 1160006, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this is the most flattering angle to shoot this beautiful woman from.<br/> <br/>I love the colors... and the quirkiness of the reflections, etc.  But... It looks like you smoothed her face and not under her chin.   Even if you didn''t smooth her face, I''d have cloned a bit of the stuff under her chin... the light accentuates minor flaws, I fear.<br/> <br/>Lovely colors.</td>', 'I wonder if this is the most flattering angle to shoot this beautiful woman from. I love the colors... and the quirkiness of the reflections, etc.  But... It looks like you smoothed her face and not under her chin.   Even if you didn''t smooth her face, I''d have cloned a bit of the stuff under her chin... the light accentuates minor flaws, I fear. Lovely colors.', '2015-07-18 22:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
