(7389102, 1159936, 103032, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote, but wanted to look through this challenge for inspiration.  I like this for the lighting, the hard light and shadows.  I like the hood as a "prop."  This portrait has a sense of drama and tension.  Perfect portrait for this eyes closed challenge.  As a viewer, I can imagine or wonder all sorts of stories this portrait portrays.</td>', 'I can''t vote, but wanted to look through this challenge for inspiration.  I like this for the lighting, the hard light and shadows.  I like the hood as a "prop."  This portrait has a sense of drama and tension.  Perfect portrait for this eyes closed challenge.  As a viewer, I can imagine or wonder all sorts of stories this portrait portrays.', '2015-07-19 04:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7389105, 1159252, 103032, '<td valign="top">Can''t vote, but looking through this challenge for inspiration.  I like this portrait because it looks for natural, not forced as far as having the eyes closed.  I like the lighting, very soft.  I also like the lighting that hits her shoulder, gives it nice depth.  This portrait makes me wonder what she''s thinking, reminiscing about...  This portrait is telling a story...</td>', 'Can''t vote, but looking through this challenge for inspiration.  I like this portrait because it looks for natural, not forced as far as having the eyes closed.  I like the lighting, very soft.  I also like the lighting that hits her shoulder, gives it nice depth.  This portrait makes me wonder what she''s thinking, reminiscing about...  This portrait is telling a story...', '2015-07-19 05:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
