(7389788, 1159550, 77196, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153373" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153373.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153373.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153373.gif"/></a> <br/>I awarded this image the brunette pigtail. To me, her face speaks of a lifetime of love, service, sacrifice, hard times, good times. Her expression is serene, looking like she is at peace with her life, and who she is. <br/>In ways, she reminds me of my own mother and her wonderful qualities.</td>', ' I awarded this image the brunette pigtail. To me, her face speaks of a lifetime of love, service, sacrifice, hard times, good times. Her expression is serene, looking like she is at peace with her life, and who she is. In ways, she reminds me of my own mother and her wonderful qualities.', '2015-07-20 09:02:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7389791, 1159850, 77196, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153375" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153375.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153375.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153375.gif"/></a> <br/>This receives the Geriatric pigtail. To me, the tender love between the two that transcends the grave is very powerfully portrayed. This spoke to me of the relationship between my wife and I. It makes me sad for those who haven''t experienced this kind of love and devotion in their lives. And it reminds me to treasure my wonderful wife while we are still together. Thank you for sharing this.</td>', ' This receives the Geriatric pigtail. To me, the tender love between the two that transcends the grave is very powerfully portrayed. This spoke to me of the relationship between my wife and I. It makes me sad for those who haven''t experienced this kind of love and devotion in their lives. And it reminds me to treasure my wonderful wife while we are still together. Thank you for sharing this.', '2015-07-20 09:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7389792, 1159785, 77196, '<td valign="top">I awarded this image the Auburn pigtail. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153372" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153372.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153372.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153372.gif"/></a> <br/>First, she is adorable, all in white with the sweater over her shoulders and pursed lips. In some ways, she is the image of innocence. Such a nice job on arranging her clothes, hands, lighting, flower in her hair, editing. <br/> <br/>The simple faith of a child. So powerful. So moving. So beautifully captured.</td>', 'I awarded this image the Auburn pigtail.  First, she is adorable, all in white with the sweater over her shoulders and pursed lips. In some ways, she is the image of innocence. Such a nice job on arranging her clothes, hands, lighting, flower in her hair, editing.  The simple faith of a child. So powerful. So moving. So beautifully captured.', '2015-07-20 09:15:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7389797, 1159967, 77196, '<td valign="top">I awarded this is Blonde pigtail<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153374" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153374.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153374.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153374.gif"/></a> <br/>For me, this is a great image reminding me that that are those in the world who have (compared to me) very little, and yet they are thankful for what they have.</td>', 'I awarded this is Blonde pigtail For me, this is a great image reminding me that that are those in the world who have (compared to me) very little, and yet they are thankful for what they have.', '2015-07-20 09:19:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7389798, 1160178, 109227, '<td valign="top">This was my highest score - 10.  Really underrated.</td>', 'This was my highest score - 10.  Really underrated.', '2015-07-20 09:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7389801, 1159818, 77196, '<td valign="top">''Tis a fine image, regardless of what the average voters say. In the right situation, I can see this hanging proudly on the wall.</td>', '''Tis a fine image, regardless of what the average voters say. In the right situation, I can see this hanging proudly on the wall.', '2015-07-20 09:30:57.000000', NULL, 0),
